== How to read an entry ==
Every line looks like this: '''time — what changed — links'''. One sentence says what it means in plain language, then two small links in brackets:

* '''entry''' opens that change on the changelog site that reads Freebuff's code.
* '''commit''' opens the exact saved change in the code on GitHub. A commit is the raw record of one edit — the thing itself, before anybody summarised it.

A commit is not a product announcement. Some of them are internal plumbing you will never notice; those are still listed here, because a reader who wants the full record should get it. Entries that touch what you actually see are marked '''you will notice'''.

== 24 November 2026 ==
* '''14:34 — Resuming a terminal chat is limited to your own chats.''' The terminal version now validates the chat name you resume, closing a path-traversal hole that could reach other folders on the computer. '''You will notice:''' nothing, unless you were trying to do that. ([https://freebuff-changelog.nordicnode.workers.dev/c/a5dc0566e891 entry] · [https://github.com/CodebuffAI/freebuff/commit/a5dc0566e891ad9dec8fd7679b73248f8e993a84 commit])
* '''10:49 — Terminal version 0.2.37: chat titles, a sponsorship notice, and a cap on virtual machines.''' A bundle of visible changes to the CLI rather than one fix. ([https://freebuff-changelog.nordicnode.workers.dev/c/49b6612d3d85 entry] · [https://github.com/CodebuffAI/freebuff/commit/49b6612d3d8549a6d53e7ebf6f11d2d375ec5072 commit]) '''You will notice:''' the new title and the sponsorship line.
* '''09:20 — The terminal chat header stops showing an empty panel and gains a data-use line.''' The header now states what happens to your data instead of leaving a blank box. ([https://freebuff-changelog.nordicnode.workers.dev/c/12311ce1659f entry] · [https://github.com/CodebuffAI/freebuff/commit/12311ce1659f68e232e38f666eb76ca4aa96bd12 commit]) '''You will notice:''' a shorter header and one extra line of text.
* '''09:15 — Terminal chats name themselves from the first message.''' The model writes the chat title on the first send, so you no longer start with a list of untitled sessions. ([https://freebuff-changelog.nordicnode.workers.dev/c/8233bf1a0c67 entry] · [https://github.com/CodebuffAI/freebuff/commit/8233bf1a0c67becc47fd5878cac7f8767b7c4c1c commit]) '''You will notice:''' readable names in your chat list.
* '''07:17 — Groundwork for sharing access, including a "sharer" role.''' Shared fields and role names were added to the code that connects the desktop app to the cloud. Nothing to click yet. ([https://freebuff-changelog.nordicnode.workers.dev/c/66160989bbbb entry] · [https://github.com/CodebuffAI/freebuff/commit/66160989bbbbc879dcd89b7824c9f133fc9a2c55 commit])
* '''04:49 — The sponsored-consent card is worded more clearly.''' It drops the sentences about your device and states the sponsorship plainly. ([https://freebuff-changelog.nordicnode.workers.dev/c/c28636e3f4b2 entry] · [https://github.com/CodebuffAI/freebuff/commit/c28636e3f4b2db1fe9dab8983e9687f3f93d3cd0 commit]) '''You will notice:''' fewer lines to read before you agree.
* '''04:08 — On Windows, terminal commands no longer start detached.''' Detached processes could outlive the agent and leave stray windows behind. ([https://freebuff-changelog.nordicnode.workers.dev/c/24ffd585ed3a entry] · [https://github.com/CodebuffAI/freebuff/commit/24ffd585ed3a66c392397dad1c8adc4baa4897ef commit]) '''You will notice:''' this if you build on Freebuff with the SDK on Windows.
* '''00:22 — Better ordering when you resume a chat, plus a network retry.''' Resuming now ranks past chats more sensibly, and checking the agent survives a dropped connection instead of failing outright. ([https://freebuff-changelog.nordicnode.workers.dev/c/0f30e180c1f2 entry] · [https://github.com/CodebuffAI/freebuff/commit/0f30e180c1f2beadd0cf4a15830a48b7b4a27472 commit]) '''You will notice:''' fewer "try again" moments.

== 23 November 2026 ==
* '''22:37 — The profile survey inside chats was switched off.''' The questionnaire that could appear during a session no longer launches. ([https://freebuff-changelog.nordicnode.workers.dev/c/ea1ef3c88c48 entry] · [https://github.com/CodebuffAI/freebuff/commit/ea1ef3c88c4870220d0255095f9a9ef3872d618f commit]) '''You will notice:''' one less pop-up.
* '''18:39 — Comparing file changes is capped so a huge edit cannot freeze the app.''' The check that lists what changed in your files now stops early on very large inputs instead of blocking. ([https://freebuff-changelog.nordicnode.workers.dev/c/a73d97674d08 entry] · [https://github.com/CodebuffAI/freebuff/commit/a73d97674d0870188f3ae79ac3a659664ac27993 commit]) '''You will notice:''' a window that keeps responding while many files change.
* '''06:50 — Tool lists from connected servers now page, and Next.js preparation finds packages.''' Two fixes for people who connect external tools: long tool lists load page by page, and the setup step no longer fails to locate packages. ([https://freebuff-changelog.nordicnode.workers.dev/c/6b8a24286e46 entry] · [https://github.com/CodebuffAI/freebuff/commit/6b8a24286e461ffb50c21e7b0eeec04ab7f4df17 commit])
* '''06:31 — Writing to an already closed terminal is treated as a normal exit.''' Before, the agent could report an error when the command had simply finished. ([https://freebuff-changelog.nordicnode.workers.dev/c/43e05ef529da entry] · [https://github.com/CodebuffAI/freebuff/commit/43e05ef529daca1e07bdae627093e336f6535dd1 commit]) '''You will notice:''' fewer red error lines after a command ends.
* '''02:18 — Onboarding questions moved into the welcome flow, and three were retired.''' Fewer questions stand between a new user and their first task. ([https://freebuff-changelog.nordicnode.workers.dev/c/f53ca1b068b7 entry] · [https://github.com/CodebuffAI/freebuff/commit/f53ca1b068b7abbce7fd8e0239959396eafd28e4 commit]) '''You will notice:''' a shorter first-run experience.
* '''00:20 — Templates gained live previews.''' Apps built from a template can be shown running before you finish them. ([https://freebuff-changelog.nordicnode.workers.dev/c/4dbf208cbdff entry] · [https://github.com/CodebuffAI/freebuff/commit/4dbf208cbdff945fe8a0141e1b31b14d1c802f70 commit]) '''You will notice:''' a preview instead of a blank page.

